id: pm-rust-b4yl
title: Investigate tracker hash discontinuity after older SDK normalization
description: "The first Round 3 claim writes used the changelog-only SDK 2026.10.9 instead of the repo-pinned oracle 2026.10.14. That parser dropped linked-test updater metadata before hashing: history verification now reports before_hash_mismatch at entry 44 for pm-rust-bj7a and entry 74 for pm-rust-unih. All original history prefixes are byte-identical and current items match latest after_hash values. Subsequent writes use the pinned oracle. Preserve append-only records; investigate a forward-compatible migration or verifier strategy without re-anchoring or rewriting history. Default strict health skips history_drift, so its pass must not be described as history integrity."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 1
tags[3]: conformance,follow-up,history
